      <header>
        <h1>Corrosion in Water-Based Aerosol Cans: Causes, Mechanisms &amp; Industrial Control Measures — Part 1</h1>
        <div class="meta">By Absar Khan &bull; Published 11/7/2025 &bull; Technical Article (approx. 1,500 words)</div>
      </header>

      <article>

        <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of Contents">
